# dbt Fusion issue health

Open engine:v2 issues in dbt-labs/dbt-core (epics excluded unless noted)

```stat data=dashboard_meta
```

::: note
MDV keeps the page as Markdown with named CSV datasets. MDV v1 has no stacked or horizontal bars, so stacked bars are shown as crosstab tables and stacked series as lines.
:::

## Where do things stand?

```stat data=headline_kpis
```

## Is the backlog shrinking?

### Open issues over time

Open at the end of each week, by type

```chart type=line data=backlog_weekly x=week y=open_issues series=type
```

### Opened vs closed per week

Complete weeks; when closed > opened the backlog shrank

```chart type=line data=weekly_flow x=week y=issues series=series points
```

## Are we keeping up with triage?

### Open issues by triage status and age

How much is waiting, and for how long

```table data=triage_pipeline
```

### New issues answered within 48 hours

By week opened; unanswered issues count as misses

```chart type=line data=response_weekly x=week y=pct_answered_48h points
```

### Triage queue — oldest first

Open issues still labeled status:triage

```table data=triage_queue
```

## Where is the work?

### Open issues by area

Issues with several areas count in each

```table data=open_by_area
```

### Open issues by adapter

(none) = adapter-agnostic

```table data=open_by_adapter
```

## How close are the epics?

### Open epics by % of sub-issues closed

Top of the list can be closed out soon

```table data=epic_progress
```

## What should we work on, and who is on it?

### Most-requested open issues

Ranked by reactions, then comments

```table data=top_requested
```

### Open issues by assignee

Top 15, including unassigned

```table data=assignee_workload
```
